{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>BEFORE YOU BUY: </i></strong><i>This game is meant to be played online with friends. </i>There are no bots and no matchmaking available.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player becomes the Banana Keeper, who wants to keep her bananas safe. The others play as Evil Monkeys, trying to eat the Banana Keeper\u2019s bananas, disguised among NPC monkeys across the jungle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evil Monkeys must eat all the bananas. The Banana Keeper must reveal every Evil Monkey before time runs out and stop them from eating all the bananas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as Evil Monkeys</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat all bananas, if the Banana Keeper notices you, your disguise is gone, and you\u2019ll need to fool her and run away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objectives</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat all bananas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid being knocked out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide among NPC monkeys and act naturally</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running, eating, or stepping on branches makes noise, which can expose you</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/a91061cb720fa3731c9e0de87b521aed.poster.avif?t=1770139063\" width=1024 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/a91061cb720fa3731c9e0de87b521aed.webm?t=1770139063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/a91061cb720fa3731c9e0de87b521aed.mp4?t=1770139063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" 